Dear Developers,

I have already read the Mailinglist and the proposal to put the unexpected If-Statements into a _INI-Method. The problem with the DSDT I found on my new Notebook is, there are two blocks of If-Statements, but only one _INI-Method is allowed; putting both blocks into a Method of the same name gives errors and warnings.

Find the gzipped DSDT attached. If not anything else, it can serve as a bad example... though I'd be happy to find a fixed one in your download area around these days ;-)

Greetings,
Alex



